Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:41.85,blue,,0,0,0,,多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:43.35,lightblue,,0,0,0,,殿下！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:45.90,blue,,0,0,0,,可以不必理会他的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.19,blue,,0,0,0,,随便干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:49.65,pink,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢…
